{"ID":"20240515142942-8d5lxrt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515142942-8d5lxrt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142942-8d5lxrt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143229-z8zcrai\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143229-z8zcrai\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143229-z8zcrai\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:611,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:611\u0026#125;","title":"104","type":"doc","updated":"20240515143229"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143229-z8zcrai","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 815px;","id":"20240515143229-z8zcrai","updated":"20240515143229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/18"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"83歲　過胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/22"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帕金森氏症針灸復診。過去有打冬天老人流行性感冒疫苗→不可再打。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１服前方後一日有一次大便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２小便茶色→仍有宿便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３左腿仍有點麻木　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 病人好轉中，但仍不可停藥"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１雙三皇穴→退水之外，對腳無力很有幫助。　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２雙高血壓穴（足三里下五分往上刺到足三里）→可降血壓。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３雙合谷　雙迎香　雙外關→ 治鼻不聞香臭。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４雙太沖　右曲池　雙絕骨→以中風大穴治其左邊麻木。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５雙委中　雙陰谷　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６雙承山→承山有肩膀承擔起一座山的意思，故雙腳無力下此穴治之。下針必針到骨上才有效果。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１同8/18方：（補骨脂三錢　澤瀉六錢　川芎三錢　丹皮三錢　桃仁三錢　茯苓五錢　烏藥五錢　細辛二錢　白芍一兩　炙甘草五錢　炮附子三錢　辛夷三錢　厚朴二錢　枳實二錢　大黃四錢　芒硝二錢（分三包沖服）　柴胡三錢　鬱金五錢　龍膽草三錢　酸棗仁三錢）　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗水　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２HT-99斑龍丸　六兩　30x2中餐前及睡前各一次三十粒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１吃aspirin造成的中風多是左側中風。此病患左側麻木已經接近小中風的症狀，因此加針中風穴治療。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２因督脈為諸陽之會，若腰直不起來，嚴重者連頸項都無力抬頭，則命在旦夕，三天內有危險！斑龍丸含有鹿角膠、鹿茸，為補陽氣最強的藥。病人上身過胖，雙腳無力，已呈現上實下虛的危險症狀。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３此帕金森氏症因西藥服用過多，痰涎堵在經脈上，造成手抖。要等到停用aspirin一個月以後，重建血管，不會隨便撞到就黑青，眼白中沒有血絲密布，變成淡青色的眼白，左邊身體不麻木，感覺跟右邊一樣或是跟原來一樣，走路比較有力氣，才可以使用吐法攻之。否則一旦採取吐法，血液大量往上衝，aspirin造成的血管破壞可能使病人無法承受而內出血中風。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}